Sends out a surge of undeath energies into your aura.

All minions inside gain 25% speed for [2, 3, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns

All non-ghoul minions are healed by [12%, 15%, 17%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5)].

If you know Call of the Mausoleum, the time remaining to the next free ghoul is reduced by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)].

if you know Corpse Explosion or Putrescent Liquefaction the duration of those effects are increased by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)].

All non-undead foes caught inside are dazed for [4, 6, 7, 8, 10 (TL1-5)] turns.

In addition all your minions (created after you learn this spell) have a passive health regeneration.
